@reichstag_reconvene
title: Demand a reconvening of the Assembly, with no dirty tricks this time.
subtitle:[? if reichstag_fire_decree_staal: Different building, of course.?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.staal_post_protests = 1;
Q.reichstag_break = 0;

Q.commons_staal_bonus -= 1;
Q.republicans_staal_bonus -= 1;

Q.next_reichstag_time = Q.rubicon_time + 1;
Q.next_reichstag_week = Q.week + 1;
Q.next_reichstag_month = Q.month;
Q.next_reichstag_year = Q.year;

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_month > 12) {
  Q.next_reichstag_month -= 12;
  Q.next_reichstag_year += 1;
}

if (Q.pro_republic < 20) Q.pro_republic = 20;
Q.pro_republic += 10;
!}

With our limited leverage, we are only able to negotiate the reconvening of the Assembly. Staal has promised not to impede the chamber's right to assemble when it sees fit. The emergency restrictions on the free press and some political meetings have been lifted.

This is a disappointing outcome, but perhaps a vote of no confidence and new elections could turn the tide. After all, we will be able to harness the significant enthusiasm shown by the people in defiance of dictatorship.

The Assembly will convene on [+ next_reichstag_month : month +] [+ next_reichstag_year +], Week [+ next_reichstag_week +].

@rights
title: Demand the above, and [? if not reichstag_fire_decree_staal: also guarantees for democratic rights?][? if reichstag_fire_decree_staal: a repeal of the Assembly Fire Decree?].
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough leverage.
choose-if: marcher_win and total_r_alt_2 >= 35
on-arrival: {!
Q.staal_post_protests = 1;
Q.staal_rights = 1;
Q.reichstag_break = 0;

Q.army_strength -= 50;

Q.commons_staal_bonus -= 2;
Q.republicans_staal_bonus -= 2;

Q.next_reichstag_time = Q.rubicon_time + 1;
Q.next_reichstag_week = Q.week + 1;
Q.next_reichstag_month = Q.month;
Q.next_reichstag_year = Q.year;

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_week > 4) {
  Q.next_reichstag_week -= 4;
  Q.next_reichstag_month += 1;
}

if (Q.next_reichstag_month > 12) {
  Q.next_reichstag_month -= 12;
  Q.next_reichstag_year += 1;
}

if (Q.pro_republic < 20) Q.pro_republic = 20;
Q.pro_republic += 20;

Q.commons_marcher += 4;
Q.disfavored_marcher += 4;
Q.burgher_ddp += 2;
Q.guild_ddp += 2;
Q.burgher_lvp += 2;
Q.guild_lvp += 2;
Q.landed_unionist += 2;

if (Q.reichstag_fire_decree_staal) {
    Q.commons_collectivist += 4;
    Q.disfavored_collectivist += 4;
    Q.commons_sapd += 2;
    Q.disfavored_sapd += 2;
}

Q.commons_gnu -= 4;
Q.burgher_gnu -= 4;
Q.guild_gnu -= 4;
Q.landed_gnu -= 4;
Q.disfavored_gnu -= 4;
Q.total_gnu_bonus -= 4;

Q.dufour_staal_r -= 1;
Q.staal_strength -= 1;
!}

With our limited leverage, we have managed to negotiate the reconvening of the Assembly, with Staal promising not to obstruct the chamber's right to assemble as it sees fit. Furthermore, we secured an agreement that his government will not infringe upon the people's right to organize peacefully or on the freedom of the press, with Staal lifting all emergency restrictions. [? if reichstag_fire_decree_staal: This includes the repeal of the Assembly Fire Decree. ?]

This is a disappointing outcome for all our efforts, but perhaps a vote of no confidence and new elections could turn the tide. After all, we can harness the significant public enthusiasm shown in defiance of dictatorship, and we need not fear further democratic backsliding—so long as Staal keeps his word.

The Assembly will convene on [+ next_reichstag_month : month +] [+ next_reichstag_year +], Week [+ next_reichstag_week +].

@schemes
title: Demand the above, and also guarantees for the continued independence of political organizations.
subtitle: Including the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not marcher_win or total_r_alt_2 < 50: Not enough leverage. ?][? if pro_republic < 50 and weimar_votes < 45 or reichstag_fire_decree_staal: Staal is dead-set on banning the <span style="color: #700000;">Communists</span>. ?]
view-if: gnu_formed
choose-if: marcher_win and (pro_republic >= 50 or weimar_votes >= 45) and total_r_alt_2 >= 50 and not reichstag_fire_decree_staal
